  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "N\u0103m 965, lo\u1EA1n 12 s\u1EE9 qu\xE2n n\u1ED5 ra, c\xE1c th\u1EBF l\u1EF1c
      x\u01B0ng h\xF9ng x\u01B0ng b\xE1. \u1EDE B\u1ED1 H\u1EA3i Kh\u1EA9u (Th\xE1i
      B\xECnh), s\u1EE9 qu\xE2n Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m n\u1EAFm gi\u1EEF \u0111\u1ED9i
      thuy\u1EC1n h\xF9ng h\u1EADu, th\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\u1EE3 ph\u1ED3n th\u1ECBnh,
      tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t trong nh\u1EEFng h\xE0o tr\u01B0\u1EDFng m\u1EA1nh
      nh\u1EA5t."
    - "Khi \u0110inh B\u1ED9 L\u0129nh ti\u1EBFn qu\xE2n ra B\u1EAFc, \xF4ng g\u1EB7p
      ph\u1EA3i s\u1EF1 ch\u1EB7n \u0111\xE1nh c\u1EE7a Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m. Tr\u1EADn
      th\u1EE7y chi\u1EBFn kh\u1ED1c li\u1EC7t \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA9y qu\xE2n \u0110inh
      v\xE0o th\u1EBF hi\u1EC3m ngh\xE8o."
    images:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba370862297078040bbce71838be441a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba370862297078040bbce71838be441a, type: 3}
  choices: []
  nextConversation: {fileID: 0}
  isCanonical: 1
  canonical: "S\u1EED ch\xE9p l\u1EA1i r\u1EB1ng, khi con trai b\u1ECB b\u1EAFt,
    \u0110inh B\u1ED9 L\u0129nh t\u1EEBng n\xF3i: \u201CTa c\xF3 th\u1EC3 sinh con
    kh\xE1c, nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EA5t ch\xED l\u1EDBn.\u201D
    C\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y truy\u1EC1n t\u1EE5ng nh\u01B0 minh ch\u1EE9ng cho
    quy\u1EBFt t\xE2m s\u1EAFt \u0111\xE1, d\xF9 chi ti\u1EBFt b\u1EAFn t\xEAn d\u1ECDa
    hay gi\u1EA3 ph\u1EA3n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0 h\u01B0 c\u1EA5u th\xEAm sau n\xE0y."
